 Rentals of three days or more receive a 10% discount on the full rental price. The discounted total is returned by `quote()` and stored on the resulting booking. Discounted totals are rounded to the nearest euro cent.
 
 Use `availability({ start, end, kind })` to get the sorted equipment ids free for the entire period. `kind` is optional; omit it to include boards and sails. Period boundaries follow the same UTC midnight and end-exclusive rules as quotes and bookings.
+
+Use `cancel(bookingId, at)` to cancel a booking once. `at` must be a whole-hour UTC timestamp in ISO-8601 format. The service returns `{ bookingId, refund }`, with `refund` in euro cents: the unused portion of the stored booking total, prorated over its duration and rounded to the nearest cent. A cancellation releases the equipment immediately; cancelling at or after the booking end returns zero.
